    "detailed_description": "This is a tower defense game, where you can experience the charm of war from the game summary, reasonably prevent turrets, upgrade your turrets, and win victory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEasy to play tower defense games and make rational use of resources.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe enemy will advance along a fixed route, and you need to build forts on both sides of the road to eliminate them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you fail to eliminate them, the enemy will reach the finish line and the game will fail!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTotal utilization of fixed funds, suitable for setting up artillery stations!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour task is to defeat fast-moving enemies, and the simple visual style is easy to master<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQuickly moving enemies make your challenges enjoyable;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProviding a comfortable experience, killing enemies has a very rich reward.",
